Z||000031||Babygirl||09-11-2000||01:07 AM||||Just for some clarification for all you "guys":  I am female, happily married and have a 4 year old daughter.  The reason I have "jr" at tail end of my email address is because "lauradavidson" was already taken with hotmail, and my husband is a "jr".  Sorry it took me 3 days to respond - we went to the Kit Car Show in San Leandro on Saturday.  It was nice to see, but they didn't have any Lambos, only 3 Ferrari's and about 15 Cobra's.  One interesting point - we saw a 1988 black SE Fiero that had a Cadillac Northstar engine in it!  Wow!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
